   "id": "ebd9a206",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The tracker lists about 22,600 GW of capacity. Operating plants account for 38% of it.\n",
    "**Projects that are not yet built (announced, pre-construction, construction) total about\n",
    "8,500 GW**, as much as the whole operating fleet. And about 4,500 GW of projects were\n",
    "cancelled or shelved. \n",
    "\n",
    "Two statuses need care. *Cancelled - inferred 4 y* and *shelved - inferred 2 y* mean that\n",
    "GEM found no news of the project for four (or two) years and classified it as abandoned\n",
    "without an official announcement. We treat them as abandoned, and check in section 4 that\n",
    "our results hold without them."
