   "source": [
    "# 3. A first look: what runs, what is built, what is announced\n",
    "\n",
    "Before measuring abandonment, we look at the Middle East's power system across the three\n",
    "stages of a project's life. This shows what the region relies on today, what it is\n",
    "building, and what it promises."
   ]
  },
