   "source": [
    "**The world rate lies between 32% and 48%** depending on the definition. The levels change with the definition\n",
    "but the ranking of technologies and regions stays the same : in every case, nuclear and coal remain the riskiest\n",
    "technologies, solar and bioenergy among the safest, and the GCC remains far below the rest\n",
    "of the world."
   ]
  },
